# CLI uploads (vercel deploy): this file REPLACES .gitignore-based exclusion,
# so it must mirror .gitignore. Critically: .env must not ride an upload — the
# remote build must resolve the engine from the pinned github: tag, never a
# local ENGINE_PATH. secrets/ holds a live Google session and must never ride
# an upload; raw/ and cache/ are gitignored bulk this file has to restate to
# actually exclude them (they were missing here, so the mirror was incomplete).
.env*
node_modules
secrets
raw
cache
.nuxt
.output
.vercel
.data
dist
public/data
